- **Homebrew tap @ 3.3.0** (tap PR #127): resources **13→40** — full `requirements.lock` closure (mcp + transitive). Derived via `pip install -r requirements.lock --dry-run --report` (lock-faithful), NOT `brew update-python-resources` (resolved un-buildable `attrs==26.1.0`). Added `sniffio` (update-python-resources omits it), `depends_on "rust" => :build` (rpds-py/pydantic-core/cryptography sdists), `depends_on "libyaml"`. Gated by `brew reinstall --build-from-source` (built 6m13s, mcp imports OK, db-init clean) + `brew audit --strict` clean. `obs version` → 3.3.0.
