## 🔜 Next: v4.1.0 — Vault CRUD Bridge (official Obsidian CLI delegate)

Spec: `docs/specs/SPEC-next-overhaul-2026-06-22.md` (§1 resolved → **delegate**, not build-FS-direct).

Route vault CRUD (`read / write / daily / template / backlinks / recent / orphans`) through the official Obsidian CLI as obs's "hands". Thin bridge enhancement (~S effort). Trade-off documented: offline regression (CRUD requires Obsidian app running via IPC). Amends ratified D3.

**After v4.1 → v4.2:** `obs doctor structure` (PARA validator, §5.3). Spec: `docs/specs/SPEC-obs-doctor-v3.5.0-2026-06-19.md`. Blocked on rewriting nexus's stale `vault-spec.yaml` to per-vault-configurable `NN_snake_case` format first.

**Post-v4 roadmap** (IDEAS.md): graph-native discovery (shortest-path, community detection, bridge-node detection); batch ops `obs apply <plan>` (batch-tag, batch-link via bridge write-path).

